## 6️⃣ Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|
| **YouTube policy violations** (AI‑generated content, re‑use of copyrighted images) | Video removal, channel strike. | Use **public‑domain / CC0** images, or generate from SDXL with a “no‑copyright” prompt. Keep a **human review** step once a week. |
| **Voice‑clone misuse detection** | Audio flagged, demonetised. | Use **generic TTS** (no celebrity voice) and keep the **voice consistent** across channel. |
| **API quota exhaustion** (OpenAI, ElevenLabs) | Pipeline stops. | Set a **daily token/credit limit** and have a fallback to **local LLaMA** models. |
| **Revenue lag** (AdSense threshold) | No cash flow for first 2–3 months. | **Add affiliate links** from day‑1 and consider **sponsored “mention” packages** for small SaaS partners. |
| **Compute cost blow‑out** | Cloud‑GPU bills can skyrocket. | Use **spot/pre‑emptible** VMs, schedule generation during off‑peak cheap hours, and shut down GPU after each batch. |

